{"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "chunk_id": "ASM-08:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "e75cb802853d2703f19b7a054480dff64165937a93834b784aa51d65f3dcb81c", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# ASM-08 — Context Patterns"}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "chunk_id": "ASM-08:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "1f1e73bd608b3bbc02404c5180f85ed6e37fe37ddc59f32f94007dbb85a7dff4", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact analyses the contexts in which the 4CH1 papers set their questions, as\nparsed in the official exam corpus of record (SRC-QPMS-4CH1): industrial-process\nframing, everyday applications, laboratory investigations, materials engineering and\nstaged-manufacture narratives. Context is the papers' AO2 vehicle — the same core\nchemistry probed through changing scenarios — and this artifact catalogues the\ncontext families candidates will meet. Every claim is carried on a bounded,\nlocator-addressed excerpt from the run's evidence pack. Research artifact; canonical\nplanes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "chunk_id": "ASM-08:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "53d62f14f8941f5197ffbfaa0221defa1b05ce30c8ed9d1c4fd65450742c5fed", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** five observable context families and the way contexts carry application\ndemands.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (the 2019-06 1C/2C, 2020-01 1C and 2021-01 2C papers of\nthe pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** archetype anatomy (ASM-03), multi-concept mechanics (ASM-07),\nexaminer commentary on contexts (EXM family)."}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "chunk_id": "ASM-08:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "af3fccef3dfd305aedeeaa7479ee9a50641a230950fbb9bc74d89ff1b9ca20b0", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nFour context families recur. Industrial chemistry is the heaviest: ammonia and\nethanol manufacture, nitric-acid production in named stages, aluminium extraction by\nelectrolysis and zinc galvanising all appear as question frames. Everyday\napplication contexts (pencils, cutting tools, airships, fire extinguishers) carry\nstructure-property reasoning. Laboratory-investigation contexts (chromatography,\nrates, temperature change) carry the practical strand. And staged narratives —\n\"manufactured in three stages\" — chain several reactions into one question. Across\nall families the pattern is constant: the context is new, the chemistry is spec\ncore; the papers use context to test application, never to test exotic facts."}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "chunk_id": "ASM-08:sec:MAIN_ANALYSIS", "content_sha256": "7fb62975e791ae44ab0c85c87c0d040939264ba410482842e28232986fbe958b", "heading": "Main Analysis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Main Analysis"}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "chunk_id": "ASM-08:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "c5e72a044675229ca8d7aa21d74163a71fe10d30f6ee3244ffb235588a098d4e", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the 2019-06 1C/2C, 2020-01 1C and 2021-01 2C\nofficial extractions (bounded line-window excerpts, locators preserved, embedded\nmark-scheme text cited verbatim). No ER evidence consumed; no specimen material\ncited; supplementary sources not consumed for claims."}
{"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "chunk_id": "ASM-08:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "b8140185be89741a009b0c99f6fa479d82df9fff4ed9a7d74756c48fbdf284d7", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "ASM-08", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "assessment_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": true, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe context inventory is observed over four paper files of the pack; additional\ncontext families (e.g. environmental/acid-rain frames) appear in the corpus but were\nnot excerpted into this pack and are therefore not catalogued here. Context-to-AO\nmapping is asserted qualitatively from the stems' demands, not statistically. No\ncanonical planes were written."}
